- AN-6 (system): Fact-check (disputed): The Internet Watch Foundation has published extensively on AI-generated CSAM, but no authoritative source corroborates the specific claim of 20,000 AI-generated images on a single dark web forum in a single month in 2023. The IWF's actual 2023 reports documented thousands of AI-generated CSAM images spread across multiple platforms, not concentrated on one forum. The underlying trend — a rapid surge in AI-generated CSAM — is real and well-documented, but this particular statistic appears to be a significant inflation or conflation of the IWF's published findings. Anyone quoting this number in a policy setting should demand a primary source, because the IWF's own reports do not contain it.
